<!-- Parity fixture, hand-written for ProjectCraft's tests from Microsoft's published MSPDI schema
     documentation (learn.microsoft.com/office-project/xml-data-interchange). An invented plan:
     the tasks, people, rates and dates are made up. No Microsoft file was used.

     What it exercises: a summary task, work, material and cost resources, a resource's own
     calendar (a part-time week and a day of leave), assignments whose work and units set their
     tasks' durations, one task with two people on different calendars, the Fixed Units, Fixed
     Duration and Fixed Work task types, effort-driven tasks, fixed costs and a milestone after two
     predecessors, in pounds.

     Each task's Start and Finish are written as Microsoft Project would work them out by its
     published scheduling rules, worked by hand. The project calendar: Monday to Friday 08:00 to
     12:00 and 13:00 to 17:00, a day is 8 hours. Ellis Mensah's calendar is based on it with
     Thursdays and Fridays off and leave on Wednesday 10 June 2026. Each assignment is scheduled
     on its resource's calendar and a task runs from its first assignment's start to its last
     assignment's finish:

      2 Strip out, Dana 100%, 24h of work: Mon 1 to Wed 3 Jun.
      3 First fix plumbing, FS from 2, Ellis 100%, 24h: Ellis doesn't work Thu 4 or Fri 5 Jun,
        so Mon 8, Tue 9, (leave Wed 10, off Thu and Fri), Mon 15 Jun. 8 Jun to 15 Jun.
      4 Fit the units, FS from 3, from Tue 16 Jun: Dana 100% 16h is Tue 16 and Wed 17; Ellis
        50% 12h is 24 hours of his working time, Tue 16, Wed 17 and Mon 22. 16 Jun to 22 Jun.
      5 Tile the walls, FS from 4, Dana 100% 16h and 12 square metres of tiles: Tue 23 and
        Wed 24 Jun.
      6 Gas safety check, Fixed Duration 1d, FS from 5, an inspection fee and a fixed cost:
        Thu 25 Jun.
      7 Paint, Fixed Work, FS from 5, Dana 100% 8h (Thu 25 Jun) and Ellis 100% 8h (Mon 29 Jun,
        his first working day after 24 Jun): 25 Jun to 29 Jun.
      1 Refit (summary): 1 Jun to 29 Jun.
      8 Kitchen handed over, milestone, FS from 6 and 7: at 7's finish, Mon 29 Jun 17:00. -->
